{
    "$comment": [
        "Forward's own targetconfig.json. Upstream's version changes almost weekly (extension approvals), so Forward keeps its own and copies only what it wants.",
        "$inherit: JSON pointers (RFC 6901; a '/' inside a key is written ~1) whose values are copied from upstream targetconfig.json, in this order. A pointer that no longer exists upstream fails the build.",
        "Galleries: the micro:bit sample galleries are hidden (Brian, 2026-10-07). They will hold Forward's code projects from the learning platform, grouped by category.",
        "Forward extensions approved upstream after v9.0.12 (fwd-fifa, ai-vision, ai-voice) are listed here directly."
    ],
